// title: 2. What verbs does AzureActivity record?
// date: 2026-10-05
// product: Sentinel
// tables: AzureActivity
// purpose: From the article: KQL Detection of the Week: The Activity Log Is Not the Activity
// source: https://devsecopsdadattack.com/2026-10-05-KQL-Detection-of-the-Week-The-Activity-Log-Is-Not-The-Activity/
// kind: article
// author: DevSecOpsDad · DevSecOpsDad (detection engineering briefs, KQL)
// archived by tools/kql_archive.py (CLAUDE.md 5l, 5eu)
// 2. What verbs does AzureActivity record?
AzureActivity
| where TimeGenerated >= ago(7d)
| where CategoryValue =~ "Administrative"
| extend Verb = extract(@"/([^/]+)$", 1, toupper(OperationNameValue))
| summarize Events = count(), Example = take_any(OperationNameValue) by Verb
| order by Events desc
